# The build context is deliberately empty: docker/Dockerfile copies no source in
# (both ways of running the image mount /app instead), so nothing needs to be
# sent to the daemon.
#
# Denying everything is also what keeps the private keys in .secrets/ and the
# ~600 MB under test-data/ and public/ out of the build entirely, rather than
# relying on this file listing each new one as it appears. If a COPY is ever
# added to the Dockerfile, un-ignore exactly what it needs with `!` lines here.
*
